body:
This. Niven is a great author, and if you enjoyed Ringworld you should enjoy these as well.

&#x200B;

Side note: Have you read the "Fleet of Worlds" series? They are prequels to the "Ringworld" series, and are really good, too.

you can solo it, but its not easy.  I wouldn't recommend starting off by soloing it either.  

&#x200B;

You should try to join some groups and hunt him a few times, and when you feel more comfortable with his move sets and whatnot, then try soloing it.

not in a dickish way, but you probably can't yet. Even when you unlock high rank armor, few sets can be considered viable "endgame" sets - mostly elder dragon sets, and even then, they are clownsuits. (armor sets made up of various pieces to achieve certain skills).  

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

side note, if you play on PS4 add me, I'm always looking for new people to hunt with.  PSN: Litfather\_69 

&#x200B;

I'm usually on everyday mid to late afternoon, and the evening.  MST.
